  "about": "What each instrument mode can do, read from that instrument's own documentation and cited. A mode key here is a mode key one of the ledgers uses, and query.test.mts ties the two together. A mode whose numbers are not stated by its documentation is left out, and the query reports it as capabilities not recorded rather than guessing. Wavelengths are micrometres, apertures metres, pixel scales arcsec per pixel; where a mode has several cameras the finest pixel scale is the one recorded, because the query uses it only as a floor that an observation cannot beat.",
